E AX3039 369-axtag-known-keys.ax:43:6-13 axtag-key-typo "AXTAG key typo on `slipped`: unrecognised key `restrct`; did you mean `restrict`?" ?"an unrecognised key is recorded and never checked, so the claim this looks like was not made. Fix the spelling, or namespace a key of your own, such as `;@axiom:my:KEY(...)`, so it cannot be mistaken for a claim"
